            "description": "The EmailBroadcastRecv receiver is registered dynamically in MainActivity for the 'edu.ksu.cs.action.EMAIL' action without any permission guards. It extracts 'email' and 'text' extras from the incoming intent and uses them to launch the private EmailActivity.",
            "file": "sources/edu/ksu/cs/benign/EmailBroadcastRecv.java",
            "location": "sources/edu/ksu/cs/benign/EmailBroadcastRecv.java:9-12",
            "line": 9,
            "line_start": 9,
            "line_end": 12,
            "impact": "An external malicious app can send a broadcast to trigger the launch of the private EmailActivity with arbitrary content, which could be used to display deceptive information to the user.",
